{"nodes": [{"id": "mobile_dev_plan_soundboss_mobile", "label": "SoundBoss Mobile \u2014 plan de d\u00e9veloppement (Expo SDK 54)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "mobile_dev_plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "mobile_dev_plan_design_system", "label": "Design system h\u00e9rit\u00e9 du web (palette sombre, Plus Jakarta Sans)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "mobile_dev_plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "mobile_dev_plan_mesure_faisabilite_labo", "label": "\u00a74 quater \u2014 Mesure de faisabilit\u00e9 du labo audio (Pocophone F1)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "mobile_dev_plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "decodeAudioData natif : 5292/5905/5673 ms, 103,2 Mo ; \u00e0 22 050 Hz : 5427/6474 ms, 51,6 Mo ; StreamerNode muet, \u00e9court\u00e9, ferme l'app. Le d\u00e9codage complet tient trois fois de suite sur un appareil de 2018 ; r\u00e9\u00e9chantillonner ne fait pas gagner de temps, seulement de la m\u00e9moire."}, {"id": "mobile_dev_plan_decodage_a_samplerate_contexte", "label": "D\u00e9coder \u00e0 contexte.sampleRate (correctif de la lecture trop rapide)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "mobile_dev_plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "getComputedPlaybackRateValue ne renvoie que playbackRate * detune, sans terme de rapport de fr\u00e9quences : l'index de lecture avance d'un \u00e9chantillon du tampon par image de sortie. Un fichier 44 100 Hz dans un contexte 48 000 Hz sortait 1,088\u00d7 trop vite, soit un demi-ton et demi trop haut."}, {"id": "mobile_dev_plan_cache_tampon_decode", "label": "Un seul tampon d\u00e9cod\u00e9 vivant, gard\u00e9 en cache", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "mobile_dev_plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Gard\u00e9 d'une ouverture \u00e0 l'autre pour \u00e9viter de repayer les cinq secondes, rel\u00e2ch\u00e9 \u00e0 l'ouverture d'un autre morceau ou au passage en arri\u00e8re-plan. Le vrai co\u00fbt n'est pas la m\u00e9moire mais les ~5,5 s d'attente \u00e0 la premi\u00e8re ouverture, qui imposent un \u00e9tat de chargement explicite et interdisent de faire du labo le geste d'\u00e9coute par d\u00e9faut."}, {"id": "mobile_dev_plan_detection_tonalite_krumhansl", "label": "\u00a74 quinquies \u2014 D\u00e9tection de tonalit\u00e9 (Krumhansl-Schmuckler)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "mobile_dev_plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Trois exactes sur quatre vrais morceaux ; le rat\u00e9 module en cours de route et aucune d\u00e9tection \u00e0 r\u00e9ponse unique ne peut avoir raison sur une pi\u00e8ce qui change de tonalit\u00e9. Tempo \u00e0 moins de 2 % d'\u00e9cart. D\u00e9cision : garder la d\u00e9tection maison, Fadr r\u00e9serv\u00e9 aux stems."}, {"id": "mobile_dev_plan_confiance_non_calibree", "label": "Score de confiance non pr\u00e9dictif \u2014 bandeau \u00ab d\u00e9tection incertaine \u00bb retir\u00e9", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "mobile_dev_plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Les deux valeurs les plus basses correspondent \u00e0 des r\u00e9ponses justes, la plus haute \u00e0 une fausse : un seuil \u00e0 0,05 aurait d\u00e9sign\u00e9 les bonnes r\u00e9ponses et laiss\u00e9 passer les mauvaises. La colonne reste aliment\u00e9e mais aucune d\u00e9cision ne s'y appuie tant qu'elle n'est pas calibr\u00e9e."}, {"id": "mobile_dev_plan_chaine_push", "label": "Cha\u00eene push serveur (triggers \u2192 ff_enqueue_notif \u2192 send-push)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "mobile_dev_plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Non versionn\u00e9e dans le d\u00e9p\u00f4t : send-push et les triggers n'existent que sur le projet distant, \u00e0 exporter dans supabase/ un jour."}, {"id": "mobile_dev_plan_ff_enqueue_notif", "label": "ff_enqueue_notif \u2014 fanout des notifications (SECURITY DEFINER)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "mobile_dev_plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "mobile_dev_plan_send_push", "label": "Edge function send-push (badge, lots de 100, tokens d\u00e9sactiv\u00e9s)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "mobile_dev_plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "mobile_dev_plan_app_secrets", "label": "Table app_secrets (RLS USING(false), lisible du seul service_role)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "mobile_dev_plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "mobile_dev_plan_revoke_public_ff_enqueue", "label": "Correctif du 21/08 \u2014 r\u00e9vocation de ff_enqueue_notif \u00e0 PUBLIC", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "mobile_dev_plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "La fonction \u00e9tait ex\u00e9cutable par anon (droit h\u00e9rit\u00e9 de PUBLIC) : quiconque d\u00e9tenant la cl\u00e9 anon embarqu\u00e9e dans l'APK/IPA pouvait envoyer un push arbitraire \u00e0 n'importe qui. Pi\u00e8ge : REVOKE \u2026 FROM anon, authenticated ne suffit pas, il faut r\u00e9voquer FROM PUBLIC et rev\u00e9rifier avec has_function_privilege() \u2014 le success: true d'une migration ne prouve rien."}, {"id": "mobile_dev_plan_push_tsx", "label": "src/lib/push.tsx \u2014 FournisseurPush et table device_token", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "mobile_dev_plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "mobile_dev_plan_monetisation_credits", "label": "\u00a74 bis \u2014 Mon\u00e9tisation par cr\u00e9dits (pay-as-you-go, mobile money)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "mobile_dev_plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Cible ouest-africaine : petites d\u00e9penses en mobile money (Wave, Orange Money, MTN MoMo), pas d'abonnement. Infrastructure d\u00e9j\u00e0 en base mais aucune fonctionnalit\u00e9 ne consomme de cr\u00e9dits \u2014 principal chantier restant (\u00e9tape 16). Chat, notifications, r\u00e9servations et marketplace restent gratuits pour la r\u00e9tention."}, {"id": "mobile_dev_plan_crash_expo_asset", "label": "Crash EAS au lancement \u2014 peer \"*\" de expo-audio sur expo-asset", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "mobile_dev_plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "expo-audio@1.1.1 d\u00e9clare expo-asset: \"*\" en peerDependency sans borne ; npm a install\u00e9 expo-asset 57.0.11 et l'a hiss\u00e9 \u00e0 la racine alors que le SDK 54 attend ~12.0.13, d'o\u00f9 NoClassDefFoundError AnyTypeCache. Correctif : \u00e9pingler expo-asset en d\u00e9pendance directe. npx expo install --check ne d\u00e9tecte pas ce cas car il n'inspecte que les d\u00e9pendances directes."}, {"id": "mobile_dev_plan_offline_first", "label": "\u00c9tape 14 \u2014 Offline-first (persistance React Query manquante)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "mobile_dev_plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "gcTime de 24 h d\u00e9j\u00e0 pos\u00e9 dans app/_layout.tsx, il manque le persister (@tanstack/query-async-storage-persister + persistQueryClient)."}, {"id": "mobile_dev_plan_expo_audio_lecteur", "label": "Lecteur expo-audio (notes vocales, fichiers, \u00e9coute courante)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "mobile_dev_plan.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "mobile_dev_plan_mesure_faisabilite_labo", "target": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e1_socle_labo_audio_streamernode", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "mobile_dev_plan.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "mobile_dev_plan_mesure_faisabilite_labo", "target": "mobile_dev_plan_cache_tampon_decode", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "mobile_dev_plan.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "mobile_dev_plan_decodage_a_samplerate_contexte", "target": "mobile_dev_plan_cache_tampon_decode", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "mobile_dev_plan.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "mobile_dev_plan_decodage_a_samplerate_contexte", "target": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e1_socle_labo_audio_decodeaudiodata", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "mobile_dev_plan.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "mobile_dev_plan_decodage_a_samplerate_contexte", "target": "docs_superpowers_plans_2026_08_31_lot_e2_tempo_transposition_pitchcorrection", "relation": "shares_data_with", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "mobile_dev_plan.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "mobile_dev_plan_confiance_non_calibree", "target": "mobile_dev_plan_detection_tonalite_krumhansl", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score